00:00:06.033 --> 00:00:08.133
-I'm alright.
I got married in COVID.

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:10.667
-Oh, congratulations.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:15.234
-Yeah, I -- So I've decided to
let myself go, you know?

00:00:15.234 --> 00:00:16.300
-Why?

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:18.834
-Well, hey, look,
I've been taking pills

00:00:18.834 --> 00:00:21.968
