for 15 years now, right?

00:00:21.968 --> 00:00:23.767
And I've got crap hair.

00:00:23.767 --> 00:00:25.334
I've spent tens of thousands
of dollars

00:00:25.334 --> 00:00:27.067
on this really rubbish hair.

00:00:27.067 --> 00:00:29.734
And I take these pills every day
to keep it in.

00:00:29.734 --> 00:00:31.467
But because I take the pills,

00:00:31.467 --> 00:00:35.234
it makes downstairs
not work anymore, right?

00:00:35.234 --> 00:00:37.834
So I have to take
a blue pill to counteract

00:00:37.834 --> 00:00:40.367
the brown pill
to make everything work.

00:00:40.367 --> 00:00:42.133
So, I've got two options
in life, right?

00:00:42.133 --> 00:00:44.067
I've got either "I keep my hair

00:00:44.067 --> 00:00:45.701
and I can't have
sex with anyone,"

00:00:45.701 --> 00:00:48.267
or "I lose my hair and no one
wants to have sex with me."

00:00:48.267 --> 00:00:50.133
But --
-That's a conundrum.

00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:52.434
-So, now I've got the wife,
I just,

00:00:52.434 --> 00:00:53.801
"Alright, I'm going to
lose the hair.

00:00:53.801 --> 00:00:56.968
-Yeah.
-But it's hard going bald.

00:00:56.968 --> 00:00:59.901
People pick on the --
We live in a society where

00:00:59.901 --> 00:01:01.667
we're not allowed to
fat-shame anymore, right?

00:01:01.667 --> 00:01:03.334
And I agree with that.
We shouldn't fat-shame.

00:01:03.334 --> 00:01:06.334
But we bald-shame all the time.
-Yeah.

00:01:06.334 --> 00:01:09.400
-If a man loses his hair,
you got, "Good day, baldy."

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:12.868
In Britain, the slang term for a
bald person is "slaphead."

00:01:12.868 --> 00:01:16.667
Right? Like, they actually
threaten violence against you.

00:01:16.667 --> 00:01:19.934
And no one chooses to go bald.

00:01:19.934 --> 00:01:21.334
Any man who's gone ba--

00:01:21.334 --> 00:01:22.968
And you're not allowed to
cover it up.

00:01:22.968 --> 00:01:25.601
Heaven forbid a man tries
to cover up his baldness

00:01:25.601 --> 00:01:27.968
and grows a bit out here
and whips it across.

00:01:27.968 --> 00:01:29.801
That person is a loser.

00:01:29.801 --> 00:01:32.734
Or if they a wear a wig,

00:01:32.734 --> 00:01:34.767
they're banished
from our society.

00:01:34.767 --> 00:01:37.434
If you wear a wig
